{"Title":"An Act making appropriations for the fiscal year 2024 to provide for supplementing certain existing appropriations and for certain other activities and projects","BillNumber":"H5049","DocketNumber":"HD5362","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"GOV7","Name":"Maura T. Healey","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/GOV7","ResponseDate":"2024-09-11T12:57:54.35"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5049/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":null,"EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purposes, which are to make supplemental appropriations for fiscal year 2024 and to make certain changes in law, each of which is immediately necessary to carry out those appropriations or to accomplish other important public purposes, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[],"Amendments":[]}